<title>UK: Credit Local sets 2.0 bln French franc 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 2.0 bln French franc 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN Amro Hoarre Govette and Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.375 PCT MATURITY    11.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.565   PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.94     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	DENOMS (K) 10-100-1,000 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.5 PCT OCTOBER 2001 BTAN -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
